error[E0277]: the storage cannot hold `Bits` bits
 --> tests/ui/narrow_default_too_wide.rs:5:31
  |
5 |   let _: Uint<U17, [u8; 2]> = Default::default();
  |                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `Bits` is greater than the bits of the storage
  |
  = help: the trait `numo::width::sealed::BitsFit` is not implemented for `B0`
  = note: `[u8; N]`, `[u16; N]`, `[u32; N]` and `[u64; N]` hold `8 * N`, `16 * N`, `32 * N` and `64 * N` bits
help: the trait `numo::width::sealed::BitsFit` is implemented for `B1`
 --> src/width.rs
  |
  |   impl BitsFit for typenum::B1 {}
  |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = note: required for `UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B0>, B0>, B0>, B1>` to implement `numo::width::sealed::SealedFitsBits<[u8; 2]>`
  = note: required for `UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B0>, B0>, B0>, B1>` to implement `FitsBits<[u8; 2]>`
  = note: required for `Uint<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B0>, B0>, B0>, B1>, [u8; 2]>` to implement `Default`
